          "type": "action",
          "tool": "finish",
          "action": "{\"message\": \"Fixed the defect causing `tests/drivers/adc/adc_emul` on `native_sim` to fail to build:\\n\\n1. `/zephyrproject/zephyr/boards/native/native_sim/native_sim.dts`: Added the missing `compatible = \\\"zephyr,adc-emul\\\";` property to the `adc0: adc` devicetree node.\\n2. `/zephyrproject/zephyr/drivers/adc/Kconfig.adc_emul`: Fixed the `ADC_EMUL` Kconfig dependency typo from `DT_HAS_ZEPHYR_ADC_EMU_ENABLED` to `DT_HAS_ZEPHYR_ADC_EMUL_ENABLED`.\\n\\nVerified that `tests/drivers/adc/adc_emul` builds and passes all 12 tests on `native_sim`.\", \"kind\": \"FinishAction\"}",
